OL,3,GNEWSASuspected tornado tore through
OL,4,Avillage as storm hit UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspected tornado ripped through part
OL,7,Fof a Hampshire village, leaving
OL,8,F"devastation" in its wake, a resident
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FThe weather phenomenon left a line of
OL,12,Fdamage about one mile long (1.6km) and
OL,13,Fabout 100m (328ft) wide in the village
OL,14,Fof Portchester on Thursday night.
OL,16,FSarah Horton, from the Tornado and
OL,17,FStorm Research Organisation (TORRO),
OL,18,Fsaid it was linked to Storm Austen
OL,19,Fbringing in heavy showers and changing
OL,20,Fwinds.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
