OL,3,GNEWSASuspected tornado tore through
OL,4,Avillage as storm hit UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FKevin Saunders, who lives in the
OL,7,Faffected area, said: "Our neighbours'
OL,8,Fwalls are down, trees have gone, bushes
OL,9,Fhave gone, metal fencing's gone, so
OL,10,Fit's just complete devastation."
